  dialogue:
  - At the end of a level, you'll have the opportunity to visit your camp!
  - There you can plot your course and level up characters with XP!
  - You can get XP from completing encounters, usually combat ones!
  - Did you guys hear something?
  - Idunnuh. *shrugs*
